{"_meta":{"source":"Yahoo Finance via yfinance (profile, statements, analyst estimates)","fetched_at":"2026-10-29T07:38:38+00:00","status":"ok","error":null,"last_success":"2026-10-29T07:38:38+00:00"},"data":{"profile":{"name":"Unilever PLC","sector":"Consumer Defensive","industry":"Household & Personal Products","country":"United Kingdom","city":"London","website":"https://www.unilever.com","employees":93731,"summary":"Unilever PLC operates as a fast-moving consumer goods company in the Asia Pacific, Africa, the Americas, and Europe. It operates through four segments: Beauty & Wellbeing, Personal Care, Home Care, and Foods. The Beauty & Wellbeing segment offers hair care, such as shampoo, conditioner, and styling; face, hand, and body moisturizer skin care products; and Prestige Beauty and Wellbeing products. The Personal Care segment provides soap and shower skin cleansing products; and deodorant and oral care, including toothpaste, toothbrush, and mouthwash products. The Home Care segment offers washing powders and liquids, and rinse conditioner fabric care products; and a range of home and hygiene cleaning products. The Foods segment provides cooking aids and mini meals comprising soups, bouillons, and seasonings, as well as mayonnaise and ketchup condiments; and Unilever food solutions. The company provides its products under the AXE, Clear, Cif, Closeup, Comfort, Dermalogica, Domestos, Dove, Dove Men+Care, Hellmann's, Horlicks, Knorr, LUX, Lifebuoy, Liquid I.V., Nexxus, Nutrafol, OMO, Pond's, Paula's Choice, Pepsodent, Radiant, Rexona, Sunlight, Sunsilk, Surf, TRESemmé, and Vaseline brand names. Unilever PLC was founded in 1860 and is headquartered in London, the United Kingdom.","exchange":"LSE","currency":"GBp","financial_currency":"EUR","summary_fr":"Unilever PLC opère en tant que société de biens de consommation à évolution rapide en Asie-Pacifique, en Afrique, en Amérique et en Europe. Elle opère à travers quatre segments : Beauté & Bien-être, Soins Personnels, Soins à Domicile, et Aliments. Le segment Beauty & Wellbeing propose des soins capillaires, tels que le shampooing, le revitalisant et le coiffage; des produits de soin du visage, des mains et du corps; et des produits Prestige Beauty and Wellbeing."},"valuation":{"market_cap_yahoo":103197589504,"shares_outstanding":2153539141,"trailing_pe":12.74468,"forward_pe":16.512976,"price_to_book":759.65405,"ev_to_ebitda":12.088,"ev_to_revenue":2.597,"dividend_yield":0.0337,"payout_ratio":0.4617,"beta_yahoo":0.461},"targets":{"current_price":4792.0,"mean":5188.2046,"median":5220.925,"high":5917.4204,"low":3994.4834,"n_analysts":14,"reco_mean":2.53333,"reco_key":"hold"},"calendar":{"earnings_dates":[],"eps_avg":null,"eps_low":null,"eps_high":null,"revenue_avg":13068000000,"ex_dividend":"2026-08-06","dividend_date":null},"holders":{"insiders_pct":0.02438,"institutions_pct":0.50446,"institutions_float_pct":0.51707,"institutions_n":884,"institutions":[{"name":"Achmea Investment Management B.V.","pct":0.0,"shares":39024,"value":187003008,"date":"2026-06-30","chg":1.0},{"name":"Physicians Financial Services, Inc.","pct":0.0,"shares":8444,"value":40463648,"date":"2026-06-30","chg":1.0},{"name":"Wealth Group, Ltd.","pct":0.0,"shares":8444,"value":40463648,"date":"2026-06-30","chg":1.0},{"name":"Heritage Wealth Advisors","pct":0.0,"shares":171,"value":819432,"date":"2026-06-30","chg":0.0},{"name":"Generali Investments Cee, Investicni Spolecnost, A.s.","pct":0.0,"shares":18275,"value":87573800,"date":"2026-09-30","chg":0.0}],"funds":[{"name":"VANGUARD STAR FUNDS-Vanguard Total International Stock Index Fund","pct":0.014400001,"shares":31053426,"value":148808017392,"date":"2026-07-31","chg":-0.0105},{"name":"Artisan Partners Funds Inc.-Artisan International Value Fund","pct":0.0143,"shares":30861799,"value":147889740808,"date":"2026-06-30","chg":0.32919997},{"name":"VANGUARD TAX-MANAGED FUNDS-Vanguard Developed Markets Index Fund","pct":0.0095999995,"shares":20619684,"value":9880